# The "cz bass" preset: a line with accents; every note sweeps its saw down from bright to P1 70.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 1.0
track bass
preset 70 0 0 45 120 25 0 0 128 0 128 205 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 A1 2 100
note 2 A1 1 60
note 4 C2 2 127
note 6 A1 1 70
note 8 E2 2 100
note 10 G1 2 127
note 12 A1 3 50
note 15 A2 1 127
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 24
expect peak_below -3
